  "title": "Spanish-Style Chicken and Sausage",
  "description": "A one-dish meal! Sweet Italian sausage stews with cubed chicken breasts and rice in a savory sauce with peas, tomatoes, onions, green peppers, garlic, herbs, and spices.",
